> fn [a, c](a: a, b, c: c, d) { (a, b, c, d) }
>   fn [a, c, b, d](a: a, b: b, c: c, d: d) -> (a, b, c, d) { (a, b, c, d) }
> [a, c, b, d] (a, b, c, d) -> (a, b, c, d)
